sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant App as Auth App
    participant OS as Platform Biometric API
    participant SE as Secure Enclave / TEE
    participant Srv as Auth Server

    Note over U,Srv: Enrolment (one-time, prior to first login)
    U->>App: Start enrolment
    App->>OS: Request key generation
    OS->>SE: Generate key pair, bind to biometric unlock
    SE-->>OS: Public key
    OS-->>App: Public key
    App->>Srv: Register public key for user
    Srv-->>App: Enrolment confirmed (spoken confirmation)

    Note over U,Srv: Verification (each login)
    App->>Srv: Request challenge
    Srv-->>App: Random challenge (nonce)
    App->>OS: Verify(challenge)
    OS->>U: "Scan your fingerprint" (audio + haptic prompt)
    U->>OS: Places finger / looks at camera
    OS->>SE: Match against enrolled template (on-device only)
    SE-->>OS: Match result
    alt Match succeeds
        OS->>SE: Release private key for signing
        SE-->>OS: Signed challenge
        OS-->>App: Signature
        App->>Srv: Submit signature
        Srv->>Srv: Verify signature with stored public key
        Srv-->>App: Factor accepted
    else Match fails (up to 3 attempts)
        OS-->>App: Failure + fallback to device passcode
    end
